{"title":"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems\">2013 AMC 12B #6</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2013 AMC 10B Problems\">2013 AMC 10B #11</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> satisfy the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/0/3c0e67c8e69737d0c44d4ba87e832a10fca55b96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+y^2=10x-6y-34$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"191\" height=\"18\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/d/d3da9f8c7fe0473fdd6f8597eff61d71fedda430.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/a/48a8be93c14100adb30eb5a36dac882a2e08f4ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 1 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 2 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 3 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 6 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"330\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If we move every term dependent on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> to the LHS, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/3/a93e1fa56f2bdaf8c68e2a1e48517fc77a1bc39e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 - 10x + y^2 + 6y = -34$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"207\" height=\"20\" />. Adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/3/d037f1aa313d30fe7ade693f1b672ed2a68880fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$34$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> to both sides, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/e/aaeb166b06d69a3ccef8d4ef0e1b47436592c486.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 - 10x + y^2 + 6y + 34 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"224\" height=\"20\" />. We can split the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/3/d037f1aa313d30fe7ade693f1b672ed2a68880fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$34$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/a/86aec043f217f5be9b05e9e868858daa650afdf2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x - 5)^2 + (y + 3)^2 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"180\" height=\"19\" />. Notice this is a circle with radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, which only contains one point. So, the only point is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/b/e0b7ad42dd93799f2e806a8edc40fedc21c01bd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5, -3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" />, so the sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/9/b6916f4178fea248636a04383391a117f9abbe74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 + (-3) = 2 \\implies \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"191\" height=\"28\" />. ~ asdf334\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If we move every term including <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> to the LHS, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/1/dd18bde5b66627a6df1efd5dc46ed9e3700c99e4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2 - 10x + y^2 + 6y = -34.\\]\" width=\"207\" height=\"18\" />  We can complete the square to find that this equation becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/a/b5a35b78809aaa8554858d204ba654a09ff65f46.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x - 5)^2 + (y + 3)^2 = 0.\\]\" width=\"183\" height=\"19\" />  Since the square of any real number is nonnegative, we know that the sum is greater than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  Equality holds when the value inside the parhentheses is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  We find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/5/ac52edccd81507a34589475cb65faa21d649d07f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x,y) = (5,-3)\\]\" width=\"117\" height=\"18\" /> and the sum we are looking for is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/7/7973ca732d2cb205e20ea299a2f6bfd784a9cd2a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5+(-3)=2 \\implies \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}}.\\]\" width=\"194\" height=\"28\" />  - Honestly\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ba6w1OhXqOQ?t=1810\">https://youtu.be/ba6w1OhXqOQ?t=1810</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/a-3CAo4CoWc\">https://youtu.be/a-3CAo4CoWc</a>\n</p><p>–no one\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B\">2013 AMC 12B</a></b> (